From 9c9e618c71071e4a97e868c40f5b2014ff94709d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Steven Williams <stevenwritescode@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:08:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(scripts): opt-in WebSocket for app scripts, limited
 to allowed origins

PUBLIC_SCRIPT_WEBSOCKET_ORIGINS lists the origins scripts may connect to.
Unset means scripts get no WebSocket (today's behaviour). Scripts receive a
small wrapper, not the native socket, and an app's sockets close when it is
torn down.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
